name laplace-chess
# The games Laplace plays: a play session's game, a Lichess game and a lab match, each one PGN file the application
# writes when the game ends (Laplace monorepo, ChessGameRecorder). The runtime and self-play lane of Sequence 27.3: what
# was played and how it ended, under its own source and trust class, and admitted after the game closes (27.9). A game
# Laplace played does not certify itself: it is testimony as any game is, at the class an application's own output has.
# White and Black are participants named in each record, never witnesses.
witness Laplace
# AppDerived: an application's own output (trust_classes.toml)
class AppDerived
root $LAPLACE_DATA/Games/Chess/laplace
files $LAPLACE_DATA/Games/Chess/laplace/*.pgn
after unicode
